# Wiki categories

- Canonical list: `{VAULT}/_schema/wiki-categories.json` (harness-managed).
- Drafts: `draft/Wiki/<Category>/<page>.md` only — never Wiki root.
- Prefer existing categories; new category folders are allowed when none fit.
- Do not edit `_schema/wiki-categories.json` in agent sessions — `applyDraft` updates it.
- See `harness/README.md`.
